# Vercel Postgres: Storage → your database → Connect → copy POSTGRES_URL
# In Vercel project env, set DATABASE_URL to that value (or map POSTGRES_URL → DATABASE_URL).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://..."

# From @BotFather
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="123456:ABC-DEF..."

# Supergroup chat ID (send /chatid to the bot inside the group)
TELEGRAM_GROUP_CHAT_ID="-1001234567890"

# Protect /api/cron/reminders in production
CRON_SECRET="change-me"
